OL,5,
OL,6,FThe card, discovered by Ellie Mead in
OL,7,FBicester, Oxfordshire, revealed the
OL,8,Fcache was left there in 1971 by
OL,9,Felectrician David Judd, who promised
OL,10,F"one pint best beer if penny returned".
